      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-primary/70">Purple Star Schools</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">A quick primer for Iowa educators</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">The Iowa Department of Education awards Purple Star status to schools that commit to supporting military-connected students. These are the essentials before you dig into the full guidance.</p>
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-primary/15 bg-primary/5 p-6 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-primary">Designation checklist</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-sm text-slate-700 space-y-2">
          <li>Appoint a staff member to serve as the military liaison for students and families.</li>
          <li>Maintain a public-facing page with resources for military-connected households.</li>
          <li>Offer awareness programs and supports tailored to military-connected students.</li>
          <li>Provide staff training on transitions, deployment, and related challenges.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a class="btn" href="https://educate.iowa.gov/pk-12/award-exchange-programs/purple-star-school-program" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit the state overview</a>
        <a class="btn-secondary" href="/contact/#general-contact">Schedule a planning call</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <aside class="content-card space-y-4">
      <h3 class="text-base font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-slate-900">How we can help</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Need to brief your leadership team or refine your application plan? Our staff can share sample talking points, connect you with Soldier and Family Readiness Support Specialists, and point you to peer schools already designated.</p>
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-primary/10 bg-white/90 p-6 space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-slate-900">Good to know</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-sm text-slate-700 space-y-2">
          <li>Recognition lasts three years before renewal.</li>
          <li>Applications run October through December with announcements in March.</li>
          <li>Schools that fall short can keep building capacity. State support is available.</li>
          <li>Questions? Email <a class="text-primary font-semibold" href="mailto:purple.star@iowa.gov">purple.star@iowa.gov</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <a class="btn-secondary w-fit" href="/contact/#general-contact">Ask for support</a>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

